  "items": [
    {
      "id": "HLR-01",
      "dimension": "journey-branches",
      "title": "连接窗口在 P2 报出 connecting 之前没有长时任务",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/services/VpnBackgroundTaskManager.ets:200",
      "severity": "strong",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "已修：意图在 60 秒内刚写为 connected 时，长时任务在扩展报出 connecting 之前取得。判据 O-BGTASK-13 已更新。测试「a fresh connected intent holds protection before any interface evidence」与「an old connected intent does not start protection on its own」覆盖。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-02",
      "dimension": "requirement-coverage",
      "title": "意图为 connected 时仍可能没有长时任务，违反 R-CONN-03 与 R-CONN-11",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/services/VpnBackgroundTaskManager.ets:200",
      "severity": "strong",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "与 HLR-01 同一修复。R-CONN-03 与 R-CONN-11 的连接窗口保护从意图写入时开始。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-03",
      "dimension": "journey-branches",
      "title": "前台时取消实况窗通知，下次进后台不再申请保护",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/services/VpnBackgroundTaskManager.ets:170",
      "severity": "strong",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "已修：manager 记录前台状态。前台取消通知时不置抑制并在下一拍重抢。判据 O-BGTASK-06 已更新。测试「dismissing the notification in the foreground re-arms protection at once」覆盖。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-04",
      "dimension": "journey-branches",
      "title": "P1 被冻结或死亡时没有子系统负责恢复",
      "anchor": "docs/hld/hld.md:160",
      "severity": "strong",
      "disposition": "open",
      "reason": "恢复轮询与网络回调都在 EntryAbility。P2 只重绑已有隧道。HLD C-11 称本批把恢复入口新增到扩展进程，但扩展没有恢复代码。设计文本与成品不一致。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-05",
      "dimension": "non-functional",
      "title": "HLD C-11 声称扩展进程有恢复入口，成品没有",
      "anchor": "docs/hld/hld.md:160",
      "severity": "weak",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "已修：HLD C-11 改为「P2 仍只重绑已有隧道，没有启动连接的恢复入口」，不再声称扩展进程已有恢复入口。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-06",
      "dimension": "requirement-coverage",
      "title": "HLD C-11 写了不存在的 sessionHeld 字段",
      "anchor": "docs/hld/hld.md:160",
      "severity": "weak",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "已修：HLD C-11 删去不存在的 sessionHeld 字段，改为按意图与 lastLiveAtMs 描述。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-07",
      "dimension": "state-and-persistence",
      "title": "两个进程重写同一账本且无锁，记录会丢失",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/services/SessionLedger.ets:189",
      "severity": "strong",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "每个写者只追加和压缩自己的账本文件。去重读取全部账本文件。读取按 timestampMs 合并，并按 sessionId + kind 保留第一条。压缩不再重写对方文件，并发追加不会被擦掉。O-SESSION-11、O-SESSION-12 与 O-SEAM-19 覆盖该行为。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-08",
      "dimension": "hld-contract-coverage",
      "title": "C-19 未定义并发追加与压缩的合并规则",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/services/SessionLedger.ets:189",
      "severity": "strong",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "HLD C-19 新增「并发与合并」契约：写者文件归属、跨文件去重、压缩边界、读取合并顺序。LLD 4.7 同步写入不变量。契约与成品一致。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-09",
      "dimension": "concurrency-and-timing",
      "title": "账本压缩会擦掉另一进程刚追加的行",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/services/SessionLedger.ets:189",
      "severity": "strong",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "SessionLedger 压缩只改本写者文件。集成用例 two writers append to one ledger and neither rewrite drops the other record 与单元用例 a writer compacts only its own file 钉住该行为。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-10",
      "dimension": "requirement-coverage",
      "title": "后台仍有两个界面定时器在跑，违反 R-POWER-01",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/components/BridgeStatus.ets:1097",
      "severity": "strong",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "已修：handleAppBackground 停 cacheSizePollTimer 与 connectionDurationTimer，回前台按页面可见性恢复。VpnPowerPolicy.uiTimersToStop 列出七个定时器。判据 O-POWER-01 已更新。测试「background stops UI probes but keeps the recovery watchdog」覆盖清单。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-11",
      "dimension": "interface-consumers",
      "title": "档位接口声明的界面定时器清单没有消费方",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/components/BridgeStatus.ets:1097",
      "severity": "weak",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "与 HLR-10 同一修复。档位接口的定时器清单现在包含这两个定时器。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-12",
      "dimension": "requirement-coverage",
      "title": "后台一秒健康轮询仍会触发对端、Sunshine 与媒体探测",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/components/BridgeStatus.ets:3412",
      "severity": "strong",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "已修：autoProbeConnectedPeerServices 在 lifecycleBackgrounded 时直接返回，后台健康轮询不再触发对端、Sunshine 与媒体探测。判据 O-POWER-01 的后台探测要求覆盖。设备批次在后台场景复跑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-13",
      "dimension": "requirement-coverage",
      "title": "原因词表缺系统策略与网络失效的生产者，冲突被当作普通掉线重试",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/services/SessionLedger.ets:23",
      "severity": "strong",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "已修：network_lost 由监督器在离线掉线时写。system_stopped 由 VPN 冲突码 2203002 写。快照新增 conflict 标记。判据 O-SESSION-10、O-RECONN-11、O-RECONN-13、O-STATUS-10 已更新或新增。测试「network loss defers recovery until the network returns」「a VPN conflict is recorded as a system stop and does not retry」「a VPN conflict is flagged on the snapshot」覆盖。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-14",
      "dimension": "state-and-persistence",
      "title": "两个受控结束原因没有生产者",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/services/SessionLedger.ets:23",
      "severity": "weak",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "与 HLR-13 同一修复。词表的七个原因现在都有写入方或兜底。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-15",
      "dimension": "hld-contract-coverage",
      "title": "C-19 列出的七个原因只有五个有写入方",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/services/SessionLedger.ets:23",
      "severity": "weak",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "与 HLR-13 同一修复。HLD C-19 的七个原因与生产者一致。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-16",
      "dimension": "non-functional",
      "title": "受控结束原因的两个词没有生产者",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/services/SessionLedger.ets:23",
      "severity": "weak",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "与 HLR-13 同一修复。网络原因的结束记为 network_lost，冲突记为 system_stopped。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-17",
      "dimension": "requirement-coverage",
      "title": "熄屏快照 15 s 一次，界面读取侧 5 s 后拒收",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/services/VpnPowerPolicy.ets:76",
      "severity": "strong",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "已修：对端快照与 Taildrop 快照的接受窗口由 5 秒改为 16 秒，覆盖熄屏档 15 秒周期。HLD C-04 已更新。设备批次在熄屏后复跑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-18",
      "dimension": "reverse-enumeration",
      "title": "状态为 unknown 时第二次连接仍会启动扩展",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/services/VpnSessionController.ets:116",
      "severity": "strong",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "已修：控制器在 unknown 状态且意图在 30 秒内刚写为 connected 时早退，不再第二次启动扩展。判据 O-SESSION-01 已更新。测试「a second connect during an uncertain status does not start again」与「an old connected intent does not block a connect during an uncertain status」覆盖。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-19",
      "dimension": "hld-contract-coverage",
      "title": "恢复失去令牌后会停掉它不拥有的隧道，包括用户的新连接",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/services/VpnReconnectSupervisor.ets:293",
      "severity": "strong",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "已修：STARTED 且令牌失效时先读意图。意图仍为 connected 则只记录 superseded，不再 disconnect。撤销只在用户已停止时执行。测试「a card reconnect supersedes an in-flight recovery without stopping the tunnel」与「a stop written only to the intent supersedes an in-flight reconnect」覆盖。判据 O-RECONN-10 已更新。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-20",
      "dimension": "concurrency-and-timing",
      "title": "卡片连接使在途恢复失效，恢复随后断开隧道并写入停止意图",
