      "severity": "strong",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "与 HLR-19 同一处，同一修复。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-21",
      "dimension": "concurrency-and-timing",
      "title": "无界面连接在第一次检查后不再复查用户停止",
      "anchor": "entry/src/main/ets/services/VpnSessionController.ets:132",
      "severity": "strong",
      "disposition": "oracle-added",
      "reason": "已修：后端就绪后与启动扩展前各复查一次意图。用户路径读意图，恢复路径读正向令牌。测试「a stop after the backend wait cancels the connect」与「a connect that lost its authority leaves the user intent alone」覆盖。判据 O-SESSION-09 已更新。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-22",
      "dimension": "non-functional",
      "title": "卡片在后台每 5 s 查询一次卡片服务，档位不治理它",
