      "reason": "已修：卡片刷新按档位放慢，active 每拍、background 每 3 拍、screen-off 每 12 拍。测试「the desktop card refresh slows with the power stage」覆盖。判据 O-POWER-01 已更新。"
    },
    {
      "id": "HLR-23",
